      "content": "transitional phase... i dont know. it's been months. it doesn't feel like a phase, it just feels like the end of the road. every day is the same. i wake up, i stare at the walls, and i just realize i have nothing to contribute to anyone or anything. it's like the world moved on and left me behind. why should i even keep trying to \"become\" something when there's nothing left to build on?",
